          "heading": "Organizations requires an infrastructure to implement the following:",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "ordered": true,
              "items": [
                "Provide highly reliable and available message** storage system to store real- time data",
                "Support for real-time data streaming and analysis to bring out business insights",
                "Support high throughput to store huge amount of data",
                "Provide low latency access for faster reads and writes",
                "Reduce operational cost to maintain the infrastructure efficiently"
              ]
            }
          ],
