          "id": "1-apache-kafka-in-banking-domain-use-case",
          "heading": "1. Apache Kafka in Banking Domain Use Case",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Use Case: Fraud Detection & Real-Time Transactions"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "ordered": false,
              "items": [
                "Kafka streams transaction data in real time.",
                "Producers: ATMs, mobile apps, payment gateways send transaction logs to Kafka.",
                "Consumers: Fraud detection services analyze patterns and flag suspicious activity instantly.",
                "Ensures real-time alerting, compliance, and customer protection."
              ]
            }
